  m_text: '1. Drag & Drop: Drag the pizza plates from the tray below onto the grid.

    2.
    Match Pizzas: Matching pizza slices next to each other (horizontally or vertically)
    will automatically merge onto one plate.

    3. Complete: Create a full 6-slice
    pizza of the same type to blast the plate, earn gold, and trigger combo scores!

    4.
    Boosters: Use the bottom toolbar to slice pizzas, drizzle sauce, swap plates,
    or discard stuck ones.'
